Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.71,0:00:19.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal aku sudah melarangnya,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.94,0:00:21.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi tidak bisa kuhentikan.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.67,0:00:25.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei! Sakit, tahu!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.31,0:00:42.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang, sebagai pelayan,\Nhal yang bisa kulakukan adalah
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.40,0:00:45.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,memakai segala cara
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.38,0:00:47.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,untuk senantiasa melindungi Nona.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.07,0:01:01.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.04,0:01:16.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.65,0:01:18.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Luar biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:19.43,0:01:20.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lumayan juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.45,0:01:24.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi masih belum cukup.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.46,0:03:03.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Nia!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.99,0:03:06.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bocah?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.15,0:03:07.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa ada bocah di sini?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.43,0:03:11.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan menjawab pertanyaanmu,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.16,0:03:13.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi sarungkan dulu pedangmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.08,0:03:16.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pertarungannya sudah selesai, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.93,0:03:18.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini Arena Tarung Gelap.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.93,0:03:21.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pembunuhan pun diizinkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.18,0:03:22.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak ada alasan untuk berhenti.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.06,0:03:24.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memang benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.34,0:03:26.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi bisakah kau mengalah?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.84,0:03:30.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pertarungan tadi sangat adil.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.09,0:03:34.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Murni karena Rinokis kalah\Ndari Iblis Pedang.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.81,0:03:36.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cuma sebatas itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.13,0:03:38.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rinokis yang menyerang duluan.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.69,0:03:43.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak banyak yang bisa\Nmenghadapi serangan secepat itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.28,0:03:45.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.22,0:03:51.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iblis Pedang berhasil bereaksi.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.97,0:03:55.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Untuk pertarungan sesama orang yang belum\Nberpengalaman, tingkatnya sangat tinggi.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.12,0:03:58.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sungguh pertarungan\Nantara sesama ahli bela diri.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.90,0:04:00.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itulah...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.93,0:04:03.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia bisa jadi jauh lebih kuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.65,0:04:06.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sayang sekali kalau dia mati sekarang.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.65,0:04:07.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.03,0:04:09.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi pula...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.58,0:04:13.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kau berniat membunuh\Nagar bisa bertambah kuat?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.34,0:04:15.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kehendak pedang sihir
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.88,0:04:18.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,atau kehendakmu sendiri?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.16,0:04:22.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kau tahu tentang pedang sihir?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.92,0:04:25.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.67,0:04:34.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pusatkan "Ki" ke lengan kananmu\Nyang terputus.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.12,0:04:38.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pendarahan akan berhenti\Ndan rasa sakitnya berkurang.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.45,0:04:41.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Coba kulihat.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.68,0:04:49.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.77,0:04:52.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tetaplah berkonsentrasi.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.11,0:04:59.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.24,0:05:02.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini imbalan untukmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.12,0:05:05.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena telah menunjukkan\Npertarungan yang hebat
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.99,0:05:08.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,serta mengampuni Miss Servant,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.45,0:05:12.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,ini imbalan kecil dariku.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.12,0:05:14.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akan kutunjukkan tingkat tertinggi.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.62,0:05:18.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagi ahli bela diri,\Nbukankah itu imbalan terbaik?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.89,0:05:21.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pakai botol itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.86,0:05:22.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.66,0:05:26.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dikalahkan anak yang bertangan kosong
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.72,0:05:28.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan anak yang bersenjata,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.13,0:05:32.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,kesannya di mata orang berbeda, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.75,0:05:37.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seolah kau sudah menang saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.02,0:05:40.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku paham betul kau bukan bocah biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.85,0:05:43.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akan kuuji kehebatanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.12,0:05:45.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Harus begitu, dong.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.82,0:05:48.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terakhir, aku mau tanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.48,0:05:50.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa yang menempa pedang itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.75,0:05:51.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pedang ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.93,0:05:53.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kudo Sasanosuke.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.79,0:05:55.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sasanosuke?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.42,0:05:57.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berarti itu karya awalnya, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.80,0:05:59.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pantas saja kelihatan indah.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.44,0:06:06.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia selalu membuat pedang\Nyang khusus untuk membunuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.16,0:06:08.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sang Empu Pedang, Kudo Sasanosuke.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.01,0:06:10.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karya dari masa pertengahan dan seterusnya
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.81,0:06:13.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,terlalu dipenuhi niat membunuh,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.20,0:06:15.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi karya awalnya
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.89,0:06:18.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,bukan pedang sihir yang merebut\Nkehendak penggunanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.01,0:06:22.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah, kalau begitu\Naku tidak akan mematahkannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.37,0:06:30.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lumayan, tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.30,0:06:42.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mustahil!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.06,0:06:55.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa kau sebenarnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.57,0:06:59.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah selesai?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.01,0:07:11.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya ampun.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.94,0:07:21.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hentikan pendarahan dan beri obat!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.12,0:07:23.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cepat sterilkan lukanya!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.22,0:07:24.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.87,0:07:27.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ini bisa disambung lagi?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.01,0:07:30.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa ada anak kecil di sini?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.33,0:07:32.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lengan itu!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.13,0:07:34.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau berniat menyambungkannya?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.95,0:07:40.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bisa minta bantuanmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.73,0:07:42.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu, kalau ada yang bisa kubantu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.99,0:07:45.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pinjamkan "kekuatan" yang ada di lengan itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.87,0:07:46.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tahu?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.91,0:07:48.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak. Tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.42,0:07:51.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kondisi lengan itu sekarang\Njelas tidak normal.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.88,0:07:54.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Darahnya berhenti walau tidak diikat,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.42,0:07:55.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,kondisinya juga cukup stabil.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.25,0:07:58.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku pernah melihat yang seperti ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.25,0:08:01.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Syukurlah kau cepat paham.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.70,0:08:03.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Omong-omong, kau punya uang?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.00,0:08:04.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Uang?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.86,0:08:07.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pengobatan biasa memang murah,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.75,0:08:10.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi ini butuh sihir pemulihan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.29,0:08:12.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berapa pun tidak masalah.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.57,0:08:15.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu, ya. Baiklah.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.25,0:08:17.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Heal!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.10,0:08:27.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Secara prinsip,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.43,0:08:30.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,hampir sama seperti menyembuhkan\Npenyakitku dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.14,0:08:32.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pada dasarnya, setiap manusia
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.50,0:08:35.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,memiliki daya penyembuhan\Ndan penyucian alami,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.62,0:08:37.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,lalu ditingkatkan dengan "Ki".
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.01,0:08:43.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah sembuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.98,0:08:47.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau pakai teknik gabungan\Njadi makin cepat, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.67,0:08:50.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nah, langsung saja bahas tagihannya...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.70,0:08:51.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lily!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.34,0:08:55.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kubilang dia itu putriku!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.30,0:08:56.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Awas!\N- Ah, Gand...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.72,0:08:57.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biarkan aku menemui putriku!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.51,0:08:59.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Dia ayahku.\N- Biarkan aku menemui putriku!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.89,0:09:04.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau yakin?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.50,0:09:06.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Uang hasil taruhanmu
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.04,0:09:08.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,dipakai untuk pengobatan Rinokis.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.57,0:09:09.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.70,0:09:12.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Uang sebanyak itu terlalu besar untukku.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.76,0:09:15.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga bingung mau buat apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.52,0:09:17.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang lebih penting, Nona Nia,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.03,0:09:19.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,pertarungan tadi hebat sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.27,0:09:20.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menarik?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.34,0:09:21.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, sangat menarik!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.78,0:09:24.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau aku pasti sudah kena tebas 50 kali!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.76,0:09:27.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hindari satu tebasan, dong.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.04,0:09:28.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Omong-omong,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.37,0:09:31.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,tanpa botol itu kau tetap\Nbisa mengalahkannya, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.50,0:09:32.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.00,0:09:34.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Botol itu malah mengganggu.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.65,0:09:35.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar, 'kan?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.95,0:09:39.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kukatakan kata-kata yang paling\Ningin kau dengar.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.91,0:09:41.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tangan kosong adalah yang terkuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.55,0:09:42.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.62,0:09:48.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka datang juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.32,0:09:48.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.94,0:09:51.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pengejar dari Arena Tarung Gelap.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.09,0:09:57.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gandolf, kembalilah ke bar duluan.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.01,0:09:59.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh? Bagaimana denganmu, Nona Nia?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.95,0:10:01.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan menyusul setelah mengurus mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.19,0:10:03.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kubawa mereka ke sana,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.71,0:10:05.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anzel bakal kerepotan juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.10,0:10:07.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, aku juga...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.46,0:10:09.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kuserahkan Rinokis padamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.25,0:10:12.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Tolong, ya.\N- Tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.45,0:10:15.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bakal repot kalau kau disandera.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.12,0:10:17.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.96,0:10:23.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena sudah mengganggu duel itu,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.01,0:10:27.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,mana mungkin mereka melepaskanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.02,0:10:35.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau menunggu lama?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.05,0:10:37.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.60,0:10:39.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada urusan apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.37,0:10:42.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami cuma mau kau melunasi utang.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.29,0:10:44.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Utang?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.41,0:10:46.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iblis Pedang, Asuma Hinoki.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.41,0:10:49.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Banyak uang dipertaruhkan\Npada pertandingannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.64,0:10:51.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi kau malah mengganggunya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.29,0:10:54.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ganti kerugian kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.79,0:10:55.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.26,0:10:58.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sejujurnya aku merasa bersalah.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.87,0:11:02.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena aku tiba-tiba\Nmencampuri pertarungan itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.51,0:11:03.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mengakuinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.19,0:11:05.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku minta maaf.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.60,0:11:07.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau pikir itu cukup?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.55,0:11:10.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Minta maaf saja tidak mempan!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.14,0:11:13.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi seperti yang kau lihat,\Naku ini masih anak-anak.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.73,0:11:15.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku diajak ke sini oleh ayahku
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.29,0:11:17.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,untuk mempelajari keadaan masyarakat
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.87,0:11:19.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan aku tidak berniat terlibat lebih jauh.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.15,0:11:22.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menurutmu alasan itu akan cukup?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.83,0:11:24.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kutanya balik...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.48,0:11:26.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa tidak cukup?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.16,0:11:30.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukankah di dunia ini ada orang\Nyang sebaiknya tidak diganggu?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.12,0:11:35.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menurutku, aku salah satunya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.95,0:11:36.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Atau
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.98,0:11:40.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau mau berurusan denganku?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.05,0:11:42.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yakin tidak akan menyesal?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.92,0:11:45.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau bisa bicara sepanjang itu,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.27,0:11:48.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau pasti tahu artinya tanggung jawab, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.30,0:11:49.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.58,0:11:52.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mencoreng nama kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.53,0:11:55.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau tidak dituntaskan,\Nkalian bisa malu, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.99,0:12:00.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bocah yang paham dunia bawah\Nsungguh mengerikan.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.87,0:12:01.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.22,0:12:03.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rasanya kurang memuaskan,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.02,0:12:05.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,jadi aku main-main sedikit saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.69,0:12:08.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau bisa mengalahkanku...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.46,0:12:09.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.37,0:12:12.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau bisa mendaratkan satu pukulan,\Naku akan tunduk pada kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.05,0:12:15.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa bentuk tanggung jawabku ini sudah cukup?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.82,0:12:17.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bicara apa kau?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.00,0:12:21.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau lambat paham untuk orang dunia bawah.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.67,0:12:24.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maksudku, cepat serang aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.48,0:12:25.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Paham?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.86,0:12:26.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ringkasnya...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.64,0:12:30.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku sedang menantang kalian!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.77,0:12:37.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan dendam kalau kau mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.75,0:12:49.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagus.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.25,0:12:54.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mengalahkan satu per satu itu mudah,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.34,0:12:56.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi beda cerita kalau dikeroyok.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.61,0:12:58.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lain halnya kalau boleh membalas,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.52,0:13:00.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,terus menghindar itu agak sulit.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.89,0:13:04.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah, memakai senjata kuno begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.36,0:13:16.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Asyik banget!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.94,0:13:19.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sungguh seru!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.49,0:13:32.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa-apaan kau?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.10,0:13:50.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.30,0:13:52.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi yang itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.51,0:13:56.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pedang sihir yang asli?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.73,0:14:00.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pikiranmu sudah sepenuhnya diambil alih.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.50,0:14:35.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biasa saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.58,0:14:37.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masih kurang.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.76,0:14:41.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Untuk ukuran orang biasa,\Ndia memang yang terhebat.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.04,0:14:45.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Melawan orang berbaju hitam tadi\Nmalah lebih seru.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.58,0:14:51.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah cukup, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.53,0:15:03.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Untuk ahli bela diri yang dikendalikan\Noleh senjatanya,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.51,0:15:05.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,ini sudah lebih dari cukup.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.36,0:15:16.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menyerahkan kesadaran\Npada pedang sihir kelas tiga,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.34,0:15:18.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,sebenarnya apa yang kau cari?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.11,0:15:21.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nah...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.32,0:15:23.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau lanjut?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.33,0:15:26.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah cukup.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.65,0:15:29.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tanggung jawabnya sudah cukup.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.74,0:15:31.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami tidak akan berurusan denganmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.41,0:15:34.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, kau juga jangan ganggu kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.40,0:15:37.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kejadian malam ini akan kami lupakan
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.47,0:15:40.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan kami tidak akan bicara soal kau.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.32,0:15:41.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Tapi...\N- Hentikan!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.21,0:15:43.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau juga mengerti, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.32,0:15:46.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kita lanjutkan...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.62,0:15:48.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,kita semua akan mati di sini!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.34,0:15:57.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, aku pergi dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.54,0:15:59.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau Iblis Pedang itu sadar,\Nsampaikan ini padanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.55,0:16:03.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,"Kalau kau sudah sangat kuat,"
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.27,0:16:05.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,"aku sendiri yang akan menemuimu."
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.66,0:16:07.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.35,0:16:38.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, kau sudah sadar.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.37,0:16:41.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, iya.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.77,0:16:43.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah tidak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.57,0:16:45.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, lumayan.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.86,0:16:46.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, iya.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.94,0:16:49.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekalian kuperkenalkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.67,0:16:51.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia ini pelayanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.37,0:16:53.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau ada sesuatu nanti,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.50,0:16:56.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,dia yang akan datang ke sini\Nuntuk menggantikanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.28,0:16:57.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ingat baik-baik, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.86,0:17:00.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Salam kenal, semuanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.77,0:17:02.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya pelayan Nona.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.02,0:17:05.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Salam kenal juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.05,0:17:09.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mohon bantuannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.18,0:17:09.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.83,0:17:13.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo kita pulang.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.26,0:17:23.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana keadaanmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.78,0:17:25.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak pusing?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.31,0:17:26.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.27,0:17:28.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi rasanya samar-samar,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.90,0:17:30.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,seperti sedang bermimpi.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.90,0:17:31.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.41,0:17:35.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini bukan mimpi, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.38,0:17:39.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau memang melawan Iblis Pedang\Ndi Arena Tarung Gelap
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.63,0:17:41.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan lenganmu tertebas.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.24,0:17:44.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku menyambungkannya kembali dengan sihir.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.70,0:17:54.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rinokis.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.50,0:18:03.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maafkan aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.94,0:18:05.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak kusangka
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.00,0:18:08.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau akan bertindak sampai sejauh itu
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.91,0:18:11.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,untuk menghentikanku dan melindungiku.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.34,0:18:14.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak masalah kalau memang\Nkau ingin bertarung,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.69,0:18:18.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi alasanmu bertarung adalah aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.14,0:18:21.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.64,0:18:24.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seharusnya kita bicarakan baik-baik
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.90,0:18:27.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,sampai mencapai kesepakatan bersama.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.21,0:18:29.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sangat menyesal.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.71,0:18:58.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, saya malah merepotkan Anda.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.82,0:19:03.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yah, memang merepotkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.13,0:19:06.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Muridku harusnya bisa menang\Nmelawan musuh seperti itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.01,0:19:07.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebentar...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.85,0:19:11.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi setelah kau dikalahkan,\Naku sudah membalaskan dendammu, kok.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.75,0:19:14.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia langsung tepar setelah\Nkupukul sekali pakai botol.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.34,0:19:16.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.60,0:19:19.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,harusnya Anda bisa minta maaf\Nsedikit lebih tulus lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.22,0:19:23.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anda merasa bersalah, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.83,0:19:24.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.98,0:19:27.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi saya belum memaafkan Anda, lo!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.42,0:19:29.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh, begitu?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.06,0:19:31.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukankah harus terus minta maaf\Nsampai dimaafkan?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.59,0:19:33.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kan ada kalanya orang bersikap
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.74,0:19:36.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,agak sungkan dan berpura-pura.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.49,0:19:37.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sungkan?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.77,0:19:39.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau pura-pura sungkan?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.66,0:19:41.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.25,0:19:43.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iyalah!\NMemangnya harus bagaimana?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.36,0:19:45.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soalnya kalau langsung dimaafkan...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.50,0:19:47.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,kelihatannya kan tidak enak!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.75,0:19:52.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebagai pelayan, wajar kalau bersikap\Nsungkan dulu dua tiga kali!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.46,0:19:55.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, karena Anda mendesak,\Nsaya baru memberi maaf
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.54,0:19:58.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,dengan agak terpaksa,\Nbukankah itu lebih indah?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.47,0:20:01.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tegakkan kepala Anda.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.41,0:20:03.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, mana bisa begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.63,0:20:06.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, kalau Anda bilang begitu...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.27,0:20:08.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rinokis!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:08.55,0:20:09.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.90,0:20:15.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pelayan kan memang begitu!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.90,0:20:18.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menghadapi pedang dengan\Ntangan kosong itu menakutkan!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.00,0:20:20.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi saya melakukannya, 'kan?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.48,0:20:22.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya melakukannya demi Anda!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.66,0:20:24.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tangan saya sampai tertebas, lo!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.72,0:20:27.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anda harus terus minta maaf dan memuji saya
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.07,0:20:30.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang sudah pura-pura sungkan!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.31,0:20:36.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh, Rinokis...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.75,0:20:41.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kemarilah! Tidur di samping saya!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.83,0:20:43.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Harusnya Anda tidur bersama saya!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.97,0:20:45.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Boleh, 'kan, kalau cuma begitu?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.56,0:20:47.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidurlah di samping saya!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.73,0:20:50.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berisik begitu, berarti kau sehat.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.10,0:20:51.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya tidak sehat!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.80,0:20:54.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Temani saya tidur!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.10,0:20:58.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, dia sudah tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.24,0:21:00.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bisa berdiri?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.34,0:21:02.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Manjanya nanti saja, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.04,0:21:03.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya tidak manja!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.80,0:21:05.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sadarlah sedikit,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.00,0:21:07.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,ini bukan di asrama.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.41,0:21:10.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita harus segera kembali.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.39,0:21:12.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.66,0:21:14.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lanjutannya setelah kita pulang.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.25,0:21:35.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hari ini sungguh panjang.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.56,0:21:38.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menahan rasa kantuk\Ntubuh berumur enam tahun,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.45,0:21:40.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku hebat juga bisa bertahan.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.19,0:21:44.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:45.00,0:21:46.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya ampun.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.48,0:21:48.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidur bersama, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:51.77,0:21:53.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau bagaimana lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:00.55,0:22:03.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan begini, dia tidak akan bangun\Nuntuk sementara waktu.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:08.72,0:22:12.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepuluh menit saja, deh.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:50.11,0:23:51.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,No-Nona Nia?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:51.70,0:23:53.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Nia!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:53.20,0:23:54.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pulang sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:54.28,0:23:55.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Ni...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:55.86,0:23:58.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selanjutnya,\N"Liburan Musim Panas Tanpa Rehat".
